The following is the SQ/USQ program that I promised I would post.  I got
it from a friend, and he is the one responsible for it; so please mail
any inquiries to him.  His readme in part 1 is fully self explanatory.

This posting is in four parts, each clearly marked.  When you save all
four parts, catenate them together and delete this and any mail-heading
info, plus the lines "Start of Part X" and "End of Part X".  You should
then be able to uudecode the file to produce SQ.ARC, like the following:

